<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Course Outline</title></head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626 0%, #b91c1c 100%); color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;">
    <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px;">Course Outline</h1>
    <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; opacity: 0.9;">{{courseName}}</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
    <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
    <p>Thank you for your interest! Here&apos;s the complete course outline:</p>
    
    <div style="background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0; color: #1f2937;">{{courseName}}</h3>
      <p style="color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 15px;">{{description}}</p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <div style="text-align: center; padding: 10px; background: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 8px; min-width: 100px;">
          <div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #dc2626;">{{totalModules}}</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280;">Modules</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; padding: 10px; background: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 8px; min-width: 100px;">
          <div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #dc2626;">{{totalLessons}}</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280;">Lessons</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; padding: 10px; background: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 8px; min-width: 100px;">
          <div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #dc2626;">{{duration}}</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280;">Duration</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0; color: #1f2937;">Curriculum</h3>
      <pre style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #374151; white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;">{{curriculum}}</pre>
    </div>

    <div style="background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center;">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #6b7280;">Course Price</p>
      <div style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; color: #dc2626;">${{price}}</div>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af;">One-time payment • Lifetime access</p>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
      <a href="{{clientUrl}}/courses" style="background: #dc2626; color: white; padding: 14px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;">Enroll Now</a>
    </div>

    <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px;">
      If you have any questions, feel free to reply to this email or contact us at {{clientUrl}}/contact
    </p>
    <p>Best,<br>The KKIT Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
